tsc clean for api/engine/npc-worker/settlement-worker); tests: shared
266/269 (3 pre-existing), engine 119/131 (12 pre-existing), api jest 78/78.
Not yet runtime-verified. See HANDOFF.md in the delivery bundle.

Done: continuous wall-clock candle stream (line-chart gateway, candle
aggregation, priceUpdate bucket_ts/volume, eventId dedupe, TTLs); engine
per-battle FIFO trade handling, finishBattle ordering + settlement/idle
watchdogs, continuity price DB fallback, leader resilience, dedicated
timer connection, coalescer volume accumulation + trailing flush,
risk-terminal cadence, Lua trader count.
Partial: durable NPC on/off + mode mirror, rotation session-per-round and
selection gate, force-win precedence, recent-trades ring; balance flush /
pending-debit changes, projection memo, constituent idempotency keys.

